/// keys (service `fa.app`). Methods: `isAvailable`, `readAll` (every entry
/// as a name→value map), `set` {name, value}, and `delete` {name}. Values
/// never leave the device (AfterFirstUnlockThisDeviceOnly — no iCloud
/// backup of secrets).
